      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "East of Mount Dennis, the line opened beneath the meeting of Keele Street, Trethewey Drive and Eglinton Avenue West.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Caledonia",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/caledonia-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2021",
        "text": "Construction photographs documented the open interior, with views from the lower level up to the upper concourse.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/caledonia-station-is-a-unique-open-design-on-crosstown-lrt-route"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The underground station brought LRT service to the west side of the Barrie rail corridor, between Blackthorn Avenue and Croham Road.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Fairbank",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/fairbank-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2021",
        "text": "By April the builders had finished laying rail beside the future passenger platforms.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/rail-track-complete-at-crosstown-fairbank-station-platform-level"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The community gained an underground station at Dufferin Street. The entrance plaza incorporates St. Hilda’s Parkette.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Oakwood",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/oakwood-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2023",
        "text": "Metrolinx documented the window artwork at the main entrance. Ontario artist Nicholas Pye used colour and intersecting forms in the glass.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/inside-eglinton-crosstown-s-oakwood-station"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The new station at Oakwood Avenue was the westernmost of the Crosstown’s three mined stations. Crews excavated a cavern beneath the roadway.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Cedarvale",
    "lines": [
      1,
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/cedarvale-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2022",
        "text": "Crews broke through the concrete separating two pedestrian tunnels to create the passage to the existing subway.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/crosstown-lrt-connects-cedarvale-with-eglinton-west-ttc-station"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "Line 5 reached the University branch of Line 1 here, giving riders a second subway interchange along Eglinton besides the one at Yonge.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Forest Hill",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/forest-hill-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2021",
        "text": "Workers installed supports for the overhead electrical wires at platform level while construction continued above.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/forest-hill-lrt-station-sees-important-work-at-platform-level"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The Crosstown opened an underground station at Bathurst Street. Its working name during planning had been Bathurst.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Chaplin",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/chaplin-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2020",
        "text": "Crews poured 300 cubic metres of concrete for the base of the northwest entrance in May.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/massive-concrete-work-happening-at-chaplin-station"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "LRT service reached Chaplin Crescent, where the main entrance plaza meets Chaplin Parkette.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Avenue",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/avenue-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2019",
        "text": "Metrolinx documented the station cavern under construction 32 metres below the road.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/avenue-station-room-enough-for-more-than-one-brachiosaurus"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The underground station at Avenue Road was designed with turnback tracks so trains could reverse direction.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Eglinton",
    "lines": [
      1,
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/eglinton-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2021",
        "text": "Crews completed excavation below the existing subway structure, underpinning Line 1 to make space for the lower LRT platforms.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/crosstown%E2%80%99s-eglinton-station-excavation-under-ttc-box-complete"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The new east–west platforms connected Line 5 with the Yonge branch of Line 1.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Mount Pleasant",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/mount-pleasant-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2022",
        "text": "In July, crews completed the restoration of the former Imperial Bank façade at the station entrance. The original building had been dismantled for construction in 2016.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/heritage-fa%C3%A7ade-restoration-complete-at-mount-pleasant-station"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The opening brought underground rail service to Mount Pleasant Road at Eglinton Avenue East, one stop east of the Yonge subway.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Leaside",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/leaside-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2019",
        "text": "The project incorporated extra structural supports at the southeast entrance so that future building work above it could leave the station accessible.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/as-toronto-looks-to-growth,-leaside-station-holds-design-secrets"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The former Bayview project station opened as Leaside. Its entrance plaza faces Howard Talbot Park.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Laird",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/laird-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2022",
        "text": "The last train-control signal installed on the Crosstown went in at Laird.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/final-eglinton-crosstown-lrt-signal-installed-at-laird-station"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "Laird Drive gained an underground station with special trackwork to reverse trains or hold a train clear of the running tracks.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Sunnybrook Park",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/sunnybrook-park-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2020",
        "text": "Builders were installing rails on track pads just east of Leslie Street, where the line emerges onto Eglinton.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/glass-roof-installed-over-science-centre-station-entrance"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "Light rail reached Leslie Street at the surface, between the underground stations at Laird and Don Valley.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Don Valley",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/don-valley-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2020",
        "text": "While the station still carried the Science Centre working name, crews installed glazing over its main entrance.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/glass-roof-installed-over-science-centre-station-entrance"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The station planned as Science Centre opened at Don Mills Road with a bus terminal and underground rail platforms.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Aga Khan Park & Museum",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/aga-khan-park-museum-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2019",
        "text": "Construction began in April with widening and paving Eglinton Avenue beside the future stop.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/a-look-at-the-Aga-Khan-Park-and-Museum-Crosstown-stop"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The eastbound and westbound platforms opened on Eglinton, just west of the Don Valley Parkway southbound off-ramp.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Wynford",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/wynford-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2022",
        "text": "The Crosstown works extended to the sidewalks around Wynford Drive, where Metrolinx documented street improvements in March.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/crosstown-lrt-connects-cedarvale-with-eglinton-west-ttc-station"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The surface stop brought LRT service to the west end of the Eglinton Avenue bridge over Wynford Drive.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Sloane",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/sloane-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2019",
        "text": "Workers widened Eglinton near Bermondsey Road to make room for a central rail corridor and bicycle lanes.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/coming-up-to-a-take-a-breath-in-complex-crosstown-construction"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The surface stop opened at Bermondsey Road. The project had used Bermondsey as its working name.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "O'Connor",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/oconnor-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2018",
        "text": "Work on the train guideway began late in the year. The first concrete pour followed in early 2019, before the rails went in.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/it%E2%80%99s-all-about-the-tracks-being-made-along-toronto%E2%80%99s-golden-mile"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The new surface stop served the stretch of Eglinton Avenue East between Victoria Park Avenue and Eglinton Square.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Pharmacy",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/pharmacy-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2019",
        "text": "By May the guideway was under construction at Pharmacy Avenue, with crews pouring concrete for the new rail alignment.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/it%E2%80%99s-all-about-the-tracks-being-made-along-toronto%E2%80%99s-golden-mile"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The line began serving Pharmacy Avenue on the surface, between O’Connor and Hakimi Lebovic.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Hakimi Lebovic",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/hakimi-lebovic-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2018",
        "text": "Metrolinx honoured Karim Hakimi and Joseph Lebovic in May. The stop’s paired name reflects the change in street name across Eglinton.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/behind-the-name-%E2%80%93-the-journey-to%20--get-to-%E2%80%98hakimi-lebovic-stop%E2%80%99"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "The surface stop opened at Lebovic Avenue. During planning it was known simply as Lebovic.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Golden Mile",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/golden-mile-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2017",
        "text": "Construction at Warden began with utility relocations and removal of the roadway medians.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/discover/torontos-golden-mile-enters-new-era-with-crosstown-development"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "text": "This surface stop opened at Warden Avenue, the street used as its working name during planning.",
        "source": "https://www.metrolinx.com/en/projects-and-programs/eglinton-crosstown-lrt/what-were-building",
        "dateSource": "https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/transit-in-toronto/transit-expansion/eglinton-crosstown-and-proposed-extensions/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Birchmount",
    "lines": [
      5
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/birchmount-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "2019",
        "text": "Road widening and paving were already underway at Birchmount in May, ahead of guideway construction.",
